## Safety

- Never print or commit `.env` secrets (`N8N_API_KEY`, admin passwords, Cloudflare tokens).
- Prefer skill scripts under `.cursor/skills/*/scripts/` for deploy/trigger/status.
- Restart `social-worker` after publishing/worker code changes.
